  "title": "ieee802.11be draft2.0: Correct common info len field and EML Capabilities subfield",
  "description": "* 1) According to 11be draft2.0: \"The Common Info Length subfield indicates the number of octets in the Common Info field, including one\noctet for the Common Info Length subfield.\"\n* 2) EML Capabilities subfield is equal to 2 octets, including emlsr support(1 bit), emlsr padding delay(3 bits), emlsr transition delay(3 bits), emlmr support(1 bit), emlmr delay(3 bits) transition timeout(4 bits), reserved(1 bit)",
